    <briefdescription>
<para>Thread-safety guarantee for <ref refid="classthemis_1_1process_1_1_bpmn_serializer" kindref="compound">BpmnSerializer</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><bold>Pattern:</bold> STATELESS (no shared mutable state) <linebreak/>
 <bold>Atomicity:</bold> N/A <linebreak/>
 <bold>Conflict Resolution:</bold> NO_CONFLICTS</para>
<para>Multiple threads may call serialize()/deserialize() concurrently without coordination. Serializer maintains no per-instance state.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="invariant"><para>Thread-safe for any number of concurrent callers. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="invariant"><para>No locking required. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="invariant"><para>Each invocation is independent. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
